                                "sense_id": "becfb519-62fb-31c2-80ed-59b221e89046",
                                "text": "In the pictures of places, too, an author uses economy; and for his plot, complicated and subplotted as it may seem, he cannot count on having vast stretches of eternity in which to elaborate forever."
